# Workflow Review

Run a risk-first review before marking work complete.

## Review Order

1. Correctness and regressions
2. Threading/concurrency and side effects
3. Security and dangerous command paths
4. Test coverage gaps
5. Maintainability and naming clarity

## Required Review Notes

- Top risks discovered (or "none found").
- What was tested and what remains untested.
- Any follow-up work that should become a ticket.
